{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19203","headline":"乐天示过敦诗旧宅有感一篇吟之泫然追想昔事因成继和以寄苦怀 · 刘禹锡","name":"乐天示过敦诗旧宅有感一篇吟之泫然追想昔事因成继和以寄苦怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"凄凉同到故人居，门枕寒流古木疎。\n向秀心中嗟栋宇，萧何身後散图书。\n本营归计非无意，唯算生涯尚有余。\n忽忆前言更惆怅，丁宁相约速悬车。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19203.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19203","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}